<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bourse to provide on-line directory.</title>
<headline>Singapore bourse to provide on-line directory.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stock Exchange of Singapore (SES) said on Monday it has agreed to provide an on-line corporate diary called Sky AR Directory jointly with a United Engineers Ltd subsidiary.</p>
<p>The United Engineers subsidiary has developed the on-line directory to provide up-to-date corporate announcements by listed companies, the exchange said in a statement.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
